29:17.200 --> 29:19.590
Harap komander berikan kelonggaran.

29:20.880 --> 29:23.010
Macam mana kalau dia bukan Cik Qinghe?

29:33.200 --> 29:34.400
Cik Qingyuan?

29:34.400 --> 29:36.430
Dia bukan Cik Qinghe.

29:36.480 --> 29:37.480
