Awak memang tak hormati saya langsung.

29:47.680 --> 29:48.960
Cik Qingyuan.

29:49.270 --> 29:50.160
Komander.

29:50.440 --> 29:52.070
Mata saya dah kabur.

29:52.070 --> 29:53.930
Maafkan saya, komander.

29:54.440 --> 29:55.570
Tuan, jangan marah.

29:56.160 --> 29:58.110
Dia cuma seorang hamba yang biadab,

